      "content": "but there isn't a repair shop for this. i've tried every update, every workaround, every patchable fix i could find. the logs just show the same fatal errors over and over. it feels like the core kernel is just corrupted beyond any possible recovery. there's no sense in trying to keep the power on when the system is just stuck in a boot loop of misery.",
